january 20, 2026
Accept Button
Location: Inside Incoming() → viewDocs() → DetailsViewer() → Controller()

Functionality:

When clicked, it sends a POST request to /uploadResearchFile

Updates the document status by setting acceptRequest: '1'

Passes parameters: docId, campus, eventType

Reloads the page after successful acceptance

Reject Button
Location: Same component as Accept button

Functionality:

When clicked, opens a textarea panel for entering rejection reason

Submits the rejection reason via POST to /getresearch

Updates the document status with rejectIndorse: 'true'

Includes parameters: docId, fileUrl, reasonEnd, fileType

New table relationship
ALTER TABLE researchfile 
ADD COLUMN rejected_by BIGINT(200) NULL,
ADD COLUMN accepted_by BIGINT(200) NULL,
ADD COLUMN rejected_date DATETIME NULL,
ADD COLUMN accepted_date DATETIME NULL,
ADD FOREIGN KEY (rejected_by) REFERENCES rdestaff(id),
ADD FOREIGN KEY (accepted_by) REFERENCES rdestaff(id);

